WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Raw Drive Rush follows the prerequisite knockdown.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.800
Ryu blocks the held down-forward HP.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.200
Marisa backs away and Ryu’s recorded throw attempt misses.

4
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.600
Back HP punishes the missed throw.

5
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.750
Heavy Dimachaerus and its follow-up continue the punish.

6
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.900
Held standing HP finishes the juggle.
